Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:35:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FOLLOW-UP, DO NOT MERGE until the live "Move media to
 Cloudflare" button says Done

Patch-note pictures served only from Cloudflare R2:
- next.config.mjs: the two patch-notes routes bundle the pages (.html) only,
  and exclude the pictures (the trace finds the folder on its own).
  Measured: each route 189 MB -> 14 MB traced.
- The move button and /api/admin/patch-notes/media-sync are removed (job done).
- New stills never go in the repo: .gitignore skips patch-notes media;
  scripts/patch-notes/media-to-r2.mjs uploads them (same signer,
  lib/marketing/r2.ts); ship.mjs runs it and refuses without the R2 settings.
- Brain: FACT-DAT-006 supersedes FACT-DAT-005.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
